stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Submitted
  Submitted --> Accepted
  Accepted --> Attempting
  Attempting --> DeliveredToNextHop: 2xx
  Attempting --> Deferred: 4xx / temporary DNS / timeout
  Deferred --> Attempting
  Attempting --> PermanentFailure: 5xx / Null MX
  Attempting --> Ambiguous: connection lost after DATA
  Ambiguous --> Attempting
  PermanentFailure --> BouncePending
  BouncePending --> BounceProcessed
  Accepted --> Expired
